WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.868
Every state program that kills its own citizens follows the same five stages.

00:00:04.818 --> 00:00:06.272
Program.

00:00:06.272 --> 00:00:07.829
Witnesses.

00:00:07.829 --> 00:00:09.613
Retaliation.

00:00:09.613 --> 00:00:11.136
Exposure.

00:00:11.136 --> 00:00:12.500
Reckoning.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:16.500
Residential schools followed this pattern over one hundred years.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:24.420
Alberta's eugenics program sterilized two thousand, eight hundred and thirty-four people between 1928 and 1972.

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:30.693
The Tuskegee experiment left three hundred and ninety-nine Black men untreated for syphilis across forty years.

00:00:30.693 --> 00:00:40.874
Nazi Germany's Aktion T4 program killed between seventy thousand and two hundred and seventy-five thousand people with disabilities between 1939 and 1941.

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:47.443
Canada's MAID program has now killed seventy-six thousand seven hundred and seven people since 2016.

00:00:47.443 --> 00:00:52.034
We have exceeded the lower bound of the program that was prosecuted at Nuremberg.

00:00:52.034 --> 00:00:54.602
The comparison is not rhetorical.

00:00:54.602 --> 00:00:57.011
The numbers are the government's own.

00:00:57.011 --> 00:00:59.068
The cost of speaking up.

00:00:59.068 --> 00:01:02.965
Vice-Admiral Mark Norman — charged, prosecution failed.

00:01:02.965 --> 00:01:06.852
Daniel Ellsberg — Espionage Act, charges dismissed.

00:01:06.852 --> 00:01:10.011
In every case, the whistleblower paid the price.

00:01:10.011 --> 00:01:13.943
In every case, the institution was eventually proven wrong.

00:01:13.943 --> 00:01:17.749
The question is how many people die before the reckoning arrives.

00:01:17.749 --> 00:01:22.295
MAID is currently in Stage Three to Four — Retaliation and Exposure.

00:01:22.295 --> 00:01:24.670
The witnesses have come forward.

00:01:24.670 --> 00:01:27.124
The retaliation has begun.

00:01:27.124 --> 00:01:29.295
The data is now public.

00:01:29.295 --> 00:01:34.181
The only question remaining is whether Stage Five — Reckoning — will come in time.
